WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
01 · OVERVIEW: Communicate clearly, securely, and respectfully. Thoughtful structure prevents misunderstandings with professors and teammates.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
02 · CHANNEL FIT: Pick email for records · chat for quick updates. Use clear subject lines with course code and actionable request upfront.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
03 · TO / CC / BCC: Protect group privacy using BCC for bulk notices. Check Reply vs. Reply All carefully before sending sensitive responses.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
04 · ATTACHMENTS: Verify files and cloud sharing permissions first. Enter recipient addresses last so incomplete drafts never leave prematurely.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
05 · ACCESSIBLE: Write descriptive links, plain headings & captions. Use "Download Lab Rubric (PDF)" instead of vague "click here" links.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
06 · TRY IT: Review one outgoing message from recipient view. Confirm consent before sharing private screenshots or personal details.
